  "bodyHash": "f348e6d429f7cdb1",
  "content": "\n\n![村民小屋被幾個區塊遺失的地方包圍](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9b519eebb7d1863238c1434e3be6e4efcd994f70_0.webp)\n\n## 簡介\n每次你受到傷害時，你所在的區塊會在一段時間後自行刪除。基本上就是這個原理。\n\n如果你打算使用這個套件製作影片或其他內容，歡迎隨時進行！若這麼做，請務必為我（Ambiguous Chameleon）署名，並在影片描述或留言區提供此套件的連結。感謝支持！\n\n## 作弊與指令\n\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left;\">指令</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left;\">說明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><code>/trigger ac.delete_chunk.toggle_mode</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">切換區塊刪除模式<sup>1</sup></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><code>/trigger ac.delete_chunk.toggle_instant</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">切換區塊是立即消失還是倒數消失<sup>2</sup></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><code>/trigger ac.delete_chunk.random_distance</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">隨機選取刪除區塊的最大距離<sup>3</sup></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><code>/trigger ac.delete_chunk.set_block</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">區塊將被主手持有的方塊填滿<sup>4</sup></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><code>/trigger ac.delete_chunk.set_countdown</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">修改區塊刪除所需的時間<sup>5</sup></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><code>/function ac_cheat:uninstall</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">卸載專案（僅限資料包版本！）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<sup>1</sup> 正常：預設設定；隨機：受到傷害時，會隨機刪除附近的一個區塊\n\n<sup>2</sup> 預設為倒數模式\n\n<sup>3</sup> 此設定適用於區塊模式已設為隨機的情況。預設值為 30 格\n\n<sup>4</sup> 預設使用空氣。如果手中沒有持有物品，區塊將恢復為填充空氣。僅支援 1.20.2+\n\n<sup>5</sup> 預設值為 4 秒\n\n## 精彩展示！\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/EpiJLi8pppw\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/rMQvY-Fcc4A\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/q-BkLHNSoD4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/r2gW0_gzeJ4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/oBkhXP6Nk38\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/CrlMzB20sdM\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/L9SLF3gBzYg\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/qvjKVXsqNO8\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/nBkwhmSJ9nQ\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/MfRTqcxLg50\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>",
